## Validate before done

<test command> AND <typecheck or build command> must pass — the FULL suite, not a subset.
A file is only "verified" when its colocated tests ran.

## Debugging

- Reproduce first: failing test that demonstrates the bug before any fix attempt.
- Verify the target (exact org/user/deployment) before investigating.

## Routing — delegate, don't edit directly

| Files             | Agent               |
| ----------------- | ------------------- |
| <billing/**>      | <billing expert>    |
| <auth/**>         | <security expert>   |
| <**/__tests__/**> | <test engineer>     |

Risk decides delegation, not size: 3 lines of billing → expert; 50 lines of CSS → direct.
After any agent claims done: run **karen** (independent verification) before merge.
